HB0149 Adoption discrimination-keep kids first act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Rodriguez-Williams, Angelos,
Haroldson, Hoeft, Neiman, Pendergraft and Singh and
Senator(s) Brennan, Hutchings, Ide, Olsen and Salazar
AN ACT relating to children; providing legislative findings; specifying
protections for specified adoption and foster care providers and parents;
prohibiting discriminatory actions associated with adoption and foster care;
specifying remedies and causes of action; making conforming amendments;
providing definitions; and providing for an effective date.
